SUMMARY:T.C. Steele Memorial Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:The T.C. Steele Memorial Exhibition at the Brown County Art Guild commemorates the 100th anniversary of Steele’s passing and honors his enduring artistic legacy in Brown County from 1907 to 1926. This special exhibition features a remarkable collection of landscapes\, floral still lifes\, and portraiture from regional museums\, public libraries\, and private collections – celebrating the beauty\, light\, and spirit that inspired one of Indiana’s most beloved painters. \nThanks To Our Sponsors
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/t-c-steele-memorial-exhibition/
CATEGORIES:Exhibition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/tc_steele_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
