SUMMARY:New Exhibitions pARTy
DESCRIPTION:New Exhibitions pARTy\nCelebrate summer with the Brown County Art Guild at our New Exhibitions pARTy! Explore new artwork by our Guild Artist Members in the Guild Artist Exhibition & Sale\, along with their special exhibition\, The Art of Brown County – Scenes & Views\, showcasing the beauty\, landscapes\, and iconic scenes of Brown County. Guests can also view the exceptional historic exhibition\, T.C. Steele Memorial Exhibition\, honoring one of Indiana’s most beloved artists. Enjoy an afternoon of art\, music\, meet the artists\, and enjoy complimentary refreshments as we celebrate creativity at the Guild.
URL:https://browncountyartguild.org/event/new-exhibitions-party-2/
LOCATION:Brown County Art Guild\, 48 S Van Buren St\, Nashville\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Exhibition
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyartguild.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/exhibs_pARTy_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
